# U.S.S. Defiant: Station (CR 702.184) taps 7-power Kalakscion for five-plus charge counters, so the 5+ striation
# (CR 721.2a) makes it a 7/4 artifact creature with flying and hexproof itself. Kalakscion ({1}{B}{B}, not an artifact)
# pays full price with {B} left. The hexproof (CR 702.11) then stops Bot2's Disenchant: the creature-Defiant cannot be
# chosen, so the cast is refused and the Disenchant stays in Bot2's hand.

